{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00089",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.89,
      "end_seconds": 2.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Hi there, come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.06,
      "end_seconds": 4.76,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.36,
      "end_seconds": 7.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Have you been here before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.92,
      "end_seconds": 11.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "A couple of times, uh, but not recently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.53,
      "end_seconds": 20.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Alright, what was the main thing you wanted to talk about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.02,
      "end_seconds": 39.28,
      "duration_seconds": 18.26,
      "text": "Yeah, it's a red swollen area on my leg. I don't know what's causing it. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I've also had a small cut that wasn't healing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.51,
      "end_seconds": 42.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.9,
      "end_seconds": 50.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.83,
      "end_seconds": 56.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any shortness of breath, numbness around it or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.36,
      "end_seconds": 63.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "So, um, I haven't had shortness of breath, numbness around it or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.47,
      "end_seconds": 67.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.45,
      "end_seconds": 71.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I mean, thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.58,
      "end_seconds": 74.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.13,
      "end_seconds": 80.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "I mean, just a knee arthroscopy, three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.2,
      "end_seconds": 83.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.16,
      "end_seconds": 87.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, um, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.11,
      "end_seconds": 90.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.19,
      "end_seconds": 99.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "text": "Metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.7,
      "end_seconds": 102.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.74,
      "end_seconds": 121.27,
      "duration_seconds": 17.53,
      "text": "Um, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.83,
      "end_seconds": 125.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.25,
      "end_seconds": 133.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Hmm, I have diabetes, for five years. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.1,
      "end_seconds": 138.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Okay. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.41,
      "end_seconds": 153.05,
      "duration_seconds": 13.64,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.53,
      "end_seconds": 159.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.75,
      "end_seconds": 161.59,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.52,
      "end_seconds": 166.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.05,
      "end_seconds": 174.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.55,
      "end_seconds": 191.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 109 over 66, SpO2 97 percent on room air, heart rate 90, temperature 38.2."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.98,
      "end_seconds": 193.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.43,
      "end_seconds": 197.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Alright, we'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.01,
      "end_seconds": 200.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.02,
      "end_seconds": 205.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Uh, um, of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.94,
      "end_seconds": 221.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.28,
      "end_seconds": 226.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Okay, can I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.17,
      "end_seconds": 230.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.24,
      "end_seconds": 248.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "There's a small scab where the cut was, no pus coming out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.71,
      "end_seconds": 262.85,
      "duration_seconds": 11.14,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.41,
      "end_seconds": 276.08,
      "duration_seconds": 12.67,
      "text": "Yes, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.43,
      "end_seconds": 295.83,
      "duration_seconds": 19.4,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with cellulitis. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. An abscess forming is also on my list. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a red swollen area on your leg, and no numbness around it or shortness of breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.25,
      "end_seconds": 298.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.87,
      "end_seconds": 305.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.85,
      "end_seconds": 317.04,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.45,
      "end_seconds": 341.04,
      "duration_seconds": 22.59,
      "text": "We should do a wound swab for infected wound. We should do blood tests for infection. I'd like you to take clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day, for seven days. That should help with skin infection. Mark the edge of the redness with a pen so we can see whether it spreads. Keep the leg raised on a pillow when you're sitting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.28,
      "end_seconds": 364.14,
      "duration_seconds": 19.86,
      "text": "Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. If the redness spreads or the fever gets higher, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. I'd like to see you again in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.39,
      "end_seconds": 366.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 367.11,
      "end_seconds": 372.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.03,
      "end_seconds": 384.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "So, I take the clindamycin, 300 milligrams, three times a day and come back in two days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.15,
      "end_seconds": 390.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.0,
      "end_seconds": 394.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Right, that's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}